From Dave Jones:

	One of my interests is static code analysis. As the Linux kernel
	continues to grow at an exponential rate, I believe we need more (and
	better) tools to catch bugs before they become a problem. It seems I'm
	not alone in this thinking. I stumbled across a whole slew of debugging
	tools on Microsoft's developer site, by the names of PREfast, SDV and
	Driver Verifier.

